<title>BELGIUM: Real possibility for EU-U.S. deal on Boeing.</title>
<headline>Real possibility for EU-U.S. deal on Boeing.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Foreign Secretary Robin Cook said on Tuesday there remained a real possibility that an agreement would be reached that would make it possible for the European Commission to clear the planned Boeing-McDonnell Douglas merger.  </p>
<p>&quot;There remains the very real possibility that it will be possible to reach agreement,&quot; Cook told reporters after EU Competition Commissioner Karel Van Miert briefed EU foreign ministers on the dossier.</p>
<p>Cook said Van Miert told ministers that the Commission had earlier on Tuesday received a new proposal from Boeing on the issue of exclusive supply contracts. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
